<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">仰头向长空呐喊</text><text for="L2">对着整个世界嘶吼</text><text for="L3">亲爱的 你为何悄然离去</text><text for="L4">我依然是属于你的女孩</text><text for="L5">执念太深抓得太紧</text><text for="L6">心神恍惚如坠云端</text><text for="L7">唯有苍天知晓你如今身在何方</text><text for="L8">我该如何去爱 该如何重新去爱</text><text for="L9">我又该如何交付真心 重新去信任谁</text><text for="L10">我整夜整夜无法阖眼</text><text for="L11">一遍遍哄骗自己一切安好</text><text for="L12">亲爱的 你只是比常人更难相见罢了</text><text for="L13">我把唱片放上唱机</text><text for="L14">静静候着属于我们的旋律响起</text><text for="L15">每个深夜我都在同你的孤魂共舞</text><text for="L16">夜夜我都与你的幻影翩跹相伴</text><text for="L17">我从未有机会</text><text for="L18">亲口向你道最后一声别</text><text for="L19">我明知必须放下往前走</text><text for="L20">可每一次尝试都痛彻心扉</text><text for="L21">我还能如何去爱 该怎样学会再爱</text><text for="L22">我还能如何信赖 该怎样重新相信</text><text for="L23">我整宿整宿熬着长夜</text><text for="L24">对自己轻声说我并无大碍</text><text for="L25">亲爱的 你只是匿于虚空不易寻见</text><text for="L26">我又把唱片轻放上转盘</text><text for="L27">只等那首熟悉的歌在耳边回荡</text><text for="L28">漫漫长夜里我唯有拥着你的幽魂起舞</text><text for="L29">每一个夜晚都与你的残影相伴旋转</text><text for="L30">我该怎么去爱 还能怎样再爱一次</text><text for="L31">我该怎么托付真心 还能怎样再相信一回</text><text for="L32">我彻夜难眠守着黑夜</text><text for="L33">自欺欺人地以为自己安然无恙</text><text for="L34">亲爱的 你只是隐在某处比谁都更难看清</text><text for="L35">我重新播放那张唱片</text><text for="L36">静候我们的歌声再度传来</text><text for="L37">每个夜里我都在同你的孤魂翩翩起舞</text><text for="L38">每个长夜我都与你的幻念相拥沉沦</text><text for="L39">每一个漫长深夜 唯与你残留的身影共舞</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Dancing With Your Ghost"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Sasha Alex Sloan"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Dancing With Your Ghost - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1469306713"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USRC11901644"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:12.850" end="3:09.340"><p begin="0:12.850" end="0:14.510" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.850" end="0:13.160">Yel</span><span begin="0:13.160" end="0:13.360">ling</span> <span begin="0:13.360" end="0:13.560">at</span> <span begin="0:13.560" end="0:13.750">the</span> <span begin="0:13.750" end="0:14.510">sky</span></p><p begin="0:15.840" end="0:17.610" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.840" end="0:16.370">Scream</span><span begin="0:16.370" end="0:16.540">ing</span> <span begin="0:16.540" end="0:16.710">at</span> <span begin="0:16.710" end="0:16.830">the</span> <span begin="0:16.830" end="0:17.610">world</span></p><p begin="0:19.260" end="0:20.950" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.260" end="0:19.500">Ba</span><span begin="0:19.500" end="0:19.690">by,</span> <span begin="0:19.690" end="0:19.960">why'd</span> <span begin="0:19.960" end="0:20.070">you</span> <span begin="0:20.070" end="0:20.360">go</span> <span begin="0:20.360" end="0:20.600">a</span><span begin="0:20.600" end="0:20.950">way?</span></p><p begin="0:21.360" end="0:23.420" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.360" end="0:21.550">I’m</span> <span begin="0:21.550" end="0:21.920">still</span> <span begin="0:21.920" end="0:22.440">your</span> <span begin="0:22.440" end="0:23.420">girl</span></p><p begin="0:25.590" end="0:27.240" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.590" end="0:25.890">Hol</span><span begin="0:25.890" end="0:26.150">ding</span> <span begin="0:26.150" end="0:26.370">on</span> <span begin="0:26.370" end="0:26.630">too</span> <span begin="0:26.630" end="0:27.240">tight</span></p><p begin="0:28.770" end="0:31.490" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.770" end="0:29.120">Head</span> <span begin="0:29.120" end="0: